{
  "native_artifact_sha256": "05b3ff611c9cc72dac03e61c8700c70d2410a9661f14f3ca6732450f76bf52b8",
  "sdk_segments": [
    {
      "text": "Um, after—",
      "start_ms": 660,
      "end_ms": 1620,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 0,
      "token_end_index": 4
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, that's an option too, yeah, after dinner. Sure.",
      "start_ms": 1680,
      "end_ms": 5640,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 4,
      "token_end_index": 22
    },
    {
      "text": " Today is a good day, but yeah, whatever. What would you prefer?",
      "start_ms": 6120,
      "end_ms": 10260,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 22,
      "token_end_index": 45
    },
    {
      "text": " Or 3:30. I just, yeah.",
      "start_ms": 10320,
      "end_ms": 13200,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 45,
      "token_end_index": 56
    },
    {
      "text": " Well, it doesn't matter for me, I mean—",
      "start_ms": 13740,
      "end_ms": 15000,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 56,
      "token_end_index": 71
    },
    {
      "text": " Not necessarily.",
      "start_ms": 15000,
      "end_ms": 15420,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 71,
      "token_end_index": 77
    },
    {
      "text": " 3:30 in the computer room in here, and then we can just go.",
      "start_ms": 15660,
      "end_ms": 17880,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 77,
      "token_end_index": 97
    },
    {
      "text": " Get in there though.",
      "start_ms": 18540,
      "end_ms": 19320,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 97,
      "token_end_index": 104
    },
    {
      "text": " If you can't, can you get in the front door? Oh, you haven't got a key, do you? Can none of you get in there?",
      "start_ms": 19620,
      "end_ms": 24000,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 104,
      "token_end_index": 145
    },
    {
      "text": " We. Can get in 3:30, through there.",
      "start_ms": 24000,
      "end_ms": 26280,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 145,
      "token_end_index": 159
    },
    {
      "text": " There's computer rooms in here, the MSC computer lab.",
      "start_ms": 26940,
      "end_ms": 29460,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 159,
      "token_end_index": 176
    },
    {
      "text": " I've not found that yet.",
      "start_ms": 29460,
      "end_ms": 30120,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 176,
      "token_end_index": 184
    },
    {
      "text": " All right. In here.",
      "start_ms": 30120,
      "end_ms": 30900,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 184,
      "token_end_index": 191
    },
    {
      "text": " How about if we take a—",
      "start_ms": 30900,
      "end_ms": 31620,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 191,
      "token_end_index": 199
    },
    {
      "text": " Or if you find me, I'll show you where— I'll let us all in there, and we can all go in there.",
      "start_ms": 31620,
      "end_ms": 35760,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 199,
      "token_end_index": 233
    },
    {
      "text": " We can look at— Afterwards.",
      "start_ms": 35940,
      "end_ms": 37500,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 233,
      "token_end_index": 242
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, yeah, exactly. You do need to have a key for it, though, that's the thing. It's got a locked door, but—",
      "start_ms": 37980,
      "end_ms": 41580,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 242,
      "token_end_index": 281
    },
    {
      "text": " Just bang on it.",
      "start_ms": 41760,
      "end_ms": 42360,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 281,
      "token_end_index": 286
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, somebody'll answer.",
      "start_ms": 43080,
      "end_ms": 43860,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 286,
      "token_end_index": 296
    },
    {
      "text": " Actually, I was asking Steve about that, whether we can get in there, whether he was going to get us access into there.",
      "start_ms": 43860,
      "end_ms": 48480,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 296,
      "token_end_index": 333
    },
    {
      "text": " Into what?",
      "start_ms": 49140,
      "end_ms": 49620,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 333,
      "token_end_index": 338
    },
    {
      "text": " The computer room.",
      "start_ms": 49740,
      "end_ms": 50280,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 338,
      "token_end_index": 343
    },
    {
      "text": " Okay. Yeah. It's only got— it's crap, it's only got about 4 or 5 computers in, but it would do. Quite good for our job, because it can also— it's not very abnormally many people in it very often.",
      "start_ms": 50520,
      "end_ms": 58980,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 343,
      "token_end_index": 410
    },
    {
      "text": " Is there a printer in there too?",
      "start_ms": 59760,
      "end_ms": 60720,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 410,
      "token_end_index": 420
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah. There's a printer in there. And there's a photocopier. With the code on it, yeah, yeah. It's cool, yeah.",
      "start_ms": 60720,
      "end_ms": 66780,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 420,
      "token_end_index": 458
    },
    {
      "text": " Huh. Well, and the photocopier, I haven't heard of it.",
      "start_ms": 68100,
      "end_ms": 71220,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 458,
      "token_end_index": 479
    },
    {
      "text": " Assignment.",
      "start_ms": 71340,
      "end_ms": 71760,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 479,
      "token_end_index": 483
    },
    {
      "text": " If we want to.",
      "start_ms": 72240,
      "end_ms": 72960,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 483,
      "token_end_index": 490
    },
    {
      "text": " We've got it in my computer.",
      "start_ms": 74100,
      "end_ms": 75180,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 490,
      "token_end_index": 500
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah.",
      "start_ms": 75540,
      "end_ms": 75660,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 500,
      "token_end_index": 502
    },
    {
      "text": " Whatever comments I'm thinking.",
      "start_ms": 75780,
      "end_ms": 76980,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 502,
      "token_end_index": 513
    },
    {
      "text": " So what time do we say?",
      "start_ms": 77520,
      "end_ms": 79080,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 513,
      "token_end_index": 521
    },
    {
      "text": " I just think it's better to do it afterwards than we have all the time we need.",
      "start_ms": 79620,
      "end_ms": 82380,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 521,
      "token_end_index": 544
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, that's true.",
      "start_ms": 82440,
      "end_ms": 82860,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 544,
      "token_end_index": 551
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, then have half an hour, and then we'll actually run. Out.",
      "start_ms": 83220,
      "end_ms": 85860,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 551,
      "token_end_index": 572
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah.",
      "start_ms": 86100,
      "end_ms": 86280,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 572,
      "token_end_index": 574
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah.",
      "start_ms": 87060,
      "end_ms": 87240,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 574,
      "token_end_index": 576
    },
    {
      "text": " Okay. As long as DNLG doesn't. Late.",
      "start_ms": 88980,
      "end_ms": 92220,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 576,
      "token_end_index": 591
    },
    {
      "text": " Hopefully it's not that man, so it won't matter.",
      "start_ms": 93600,
      "end_ms": 95280,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 591,
      "token_end_index": 608
    },
    {
      "text": " Actually, it's not even confirmed yet.",
      "start_ms": 98220,
      "end_ms": 99840,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 608,
      "token_end_index": 621
    },
    {
      "text": " What?",
      "start_ms": 100680,
      "end_ms": 100920,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 621,
      "token_end_index": 624
    },
    {
      "text": " Oh.",
      "start_ms": 101100,
      "end_ms": 101280,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 624,
      "token_end_index": 626
    },
    {
      "text": " She doesn't even know what she's talking about yet. Maybe it doesn't happen at all.",
      "start_ms": 101580,
      "end_ms": 106140,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 626,
      "token_end_index": 655
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, you never know.",
      "start_ms": 106920,
      "end_ms": 107940,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 655,
      "token_end_index": 664
    },
    {
      "text": " It's reading week next week. It should be. It should be.",
      "start_ms": 107940,
      "end_ms": 109680,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 664,
      "token_end_index": 685
    },
    {
      "text": " Me.",
      "start_ms": 110340,
      "end_ms": 110520,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 685,
      "token_end_index": 687
    },
    {
      "text": " Really?",
      "start_ms": 110760,
      "end_ms": 111060,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 687,
      "token_end_index": 690
    },
    {
      "text": " Well, it's supposed to be.",
      "start_ms": 111300,
      "end_ms": 112320,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 690,
      "token_end_index": 700
    },
    {
      "text": " Okay.",
      "start_ms": 112620,
      "end_ms": 112800,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 700,
      "token_end_index": 702
    },
    {
      "text": " Next week. It's week 6 next week.",
      "start_ms": 113400,
      "end_ms": 115320,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 702,
      "token_end_index": 715
    },
    {
      "text": " Really?",
      "start_ms": 115440,
      "end_ms": 115800,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 715,
      "token_end_index": 718
    },
    {
      "text": " Oh.",
      "start_ms": 115800,
      "end_ms": 115800,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 718,
      "token_end_index": 720
    },
    {
      "text": " I don't think we have a reading week though.",
      "start_ms": 116340,
      "end_ms": 117780,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 720,
      "token_end_index": 736
    },
    {
      "text": " I don't know. We have one class at least when we, like, speech perception, we don't have any. ",
      "start_ms": 117900,
      "end_ms": 121920,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 736,
      "token_end_index": 766
    }
  ],
